abstract: "PyTorch framework for Active Inference agents that act by minimizing variational and expected free energy — no reward functions, no reinforcement learning. Modular beliefs, policy, and environment modules with YAML configs, rollout/horizon planning, and orchestrators for logging, plotting, and animation."
